{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"We have not the good, hard-working nature of the honey-bee. Where is the honey-bee who steals from the hive to be found?\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T19:16:54.567000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864223817387999263","reply_to_id":"864223564545523743","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"If the queen sees a threat, like the evil gods pose on our good ones, all the bees aid in the defense of the hive.  You are the ones not joining the hive when you were asked, and started a war\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T19:18:11.335000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864224139376459807","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"There is always another. But the queen is merely a vessel for the honeybee's lives. Humanoids don't depend on their masters for life. They are built to survive without them.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T19:19:00.899000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-12T19:19:29.568000Z","id":"864224347262025738","reply_to_id":"864223787619581973","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"(Lore point... the war between good gods and evil ones in the old world still goes on.... and this rebellion is more a point against being pressed into service against your will, basically why should you fight their war, pay their taxes, serve them over there)","created_at":"2021-07-12T19:19:03.698000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-12T19:20:18.526000Z","id":"864224359001882624","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"so you said how we should be a hive, then how we shouldn't when the argument goes against what you had hoped?\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T19:19:33.940000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-12T19:20:42.606000Z","id":"864224485846417428","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"My point was less of being the hive, and more of having the structure. I speak from an outside perspective, I don't know much about the worlds systems. My insights are purely based on my natural observations from living in nature.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T19:21:55.053000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864225077717631046","reply_to_id":"864224485846417428","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"Arcania is free from war.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T19:22:52.783000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864225319853490257","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"Currently it is not, so that is a false statement\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T19:23:08.602000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864225386203054110","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"You complain about the revolution and the war it brings, but it is nothing compared to the War of the Gods.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T19:23:26.217000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864225460085719061","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"Why should we abandon the only peace there is to be found on this world?\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T19:24:00.172000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864225602503835689","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"Indeed, should we not fight for that peace?\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T19:24:10.089000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864225644099665950","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
