{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"(kk)","created_at":"2021-07-12T19:26:15.882000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864226171713880074","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"You claim that it is hatred of war that brings you to oppose the revolution. But I cannot believe that you love peace when you are more invested in victory abroad than peace at home.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T19:27:57.075000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864226596147429377","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"Finn stirs and sips his tea subtly enjoying the discourse of philosophies","created_at":"2021-07-12T19:29:26.697000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864226972049211442","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"I am no pacifist by nature, and so I find this argument unconvincing. But, equally, I cannot be made a loyalist by way of pacifism.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T19:30:38.090000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864227271493812265","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"But again, I find these conversations taxing. Politics is so limiting.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T19:32:07.207000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864227645276946452","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"I don't complain.  I point out that instead of following your leader, you decided not to.  You cast the first stone then claim the king is at fault.  You abandon your duty as citizens of the crown, living on the land of the crown, abandoning your fellows in their war across the ocean.  You decided to start a war and divide rather thanjoin.  So while you hide here in your 'peace' you leave others to die in your stead.  My claim has been that I dont like war ideologically.  It is blood for the sake of blood.  That doesn't mean I completely hate it.  The worlds are not either or.  My complaint about this war is that people seem to think that they are right or just in being defiant.  You can be fighting for something you think is right, while doing the wrong thing altogether.  I have said both side are doing grievous wrong, and you seem to think that only the other is at fault.  Blood only feeds the mushrooms and insects.  That's all war is.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T19:35:31.668000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864228502849323008","reply_to_id":"864225644099665950","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"One day there will be a world here where I won't have to host broadcasts on civilians being targeted and people getting killed for a named cause.\"\n\n\"Have you resided over the recent deceased from this morning Mr Smith?\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T19:36:29.998000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864228747502682132","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"\"If it were not the land of the crown, if we were not citizens of the crown, then would we be derelict in our duty to the crown?\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T19:37:08.146000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-12T19:38:25.127000Z","id":"864228907505942548","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
